flowchart LR
 subgraph RESEARCH[Public research]
 SOURCES[Public sources] --> PROFILE[(Sourced profile)]
 end
 subgraph AGENT[Autonomous agent]
 PLAN[Strategist] --> WRITER[Writer] --> QA[Quality gate]
 QA -->|pass| CLIENT[API client]
 QA -.->|bounded correction| WRITER
 EVAL[Evaluator] -->|branch closure| MEMORY[(Session memory)]
 MEMORY -->|next approach| PLAN
 EVAL -.->|continue or answer| WRITER
 end
 subgraph SIM[revel8 simulation]
 TWIN[Target AI twin] --> EVENTS[API observations]
 end
 subgraph EVIDENCE[Evidence and replay]
 STORE[(Saved run evidence)] --> VIEW[Read-only replay]
 end
 PROFILE --> PLAN
 CLIENT -->|message page or call| TWIN
 EVENTS -->|receipt and reaction| EVAL
 MEMORY -->|decisions and lessons| STORE
 CLIENT -.->|receipts and raw events| STORE
